{"title":"2018 OIM Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be a triangle such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/45274538eee6ed6129c877cb1be2582488d700ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2af2db1e4b88156673afcf16ce08f671108af442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BA = CA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />. A point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/7908ad0f396f05f3de405cf8f7f68d0db3ff8a7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D \\ne A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> is chosen on the semicircle of diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> that contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.  The circumcircle of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d174b94733c0b4ccf303de590d78f2fa69a05fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DAM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> intersects the lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/4/204a6f5a6757f5da4c1b3035ad8d806769744e63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DB$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54e7bde5965d66ef3ebfc6b90fba9e2723e80694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = CF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2018_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n